# (0.17.84, the maker) On Acid 1, HOLD HOME opens the settings over it; ARP closes them and shows Acid 1 again (it went on to Acid 2: the page
# under the menu counted as "inside the group"). The next ARP steps on as always.
seed 0
wait 3000
tap ARP
wait 200
expect view 12
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 300
tap ARP
wait 200
expect view 12
tap ARP
wait 200
expect view 13
# the FX menu over Acid env: ARP shows Acid env again
tap FX
wait 300
tap ARP
wait 200
expect view 13
